        "TileImage": "$($repository f08fa211-e5e8-4406-9381-2f32dd16bd30).Image",
        "Description": "There is little time, 47. A group of currently unkown people who call themsleves The Silver Senate have built an international crime empire over night. Since we don&apos;t know any of the Senators, we will have to send them a message. One of their many &quot;armies&quot; is a biker gang located in Club Hölle. The Senate is very causious, so eliminating some of them will draw their attention. They&apos;ll want to know who striked them.\rOne more thing, 47. Other agents are there too. Don&apos;t let them recognise you.",
